src/fv_engine.py is a thin adaptation of examples/soccer/main.py. It reuses
that project's TeamClassifier (SigLIP -> UMAP -> KMeans over player crops),
ViewTransformer, and SoccerPitchConfiguration substantially unchanged, and
its football-trained detection weights.

